```

The maximal value is attained at  

\[
m=25,\qquad n=37,\qquad F_{\max}=5\cdot25+7\cdot37=384 .
\]

--------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5.  Realising the sum \(2025\)

For \((m,n)=(25,37)\)

\[
S_{\min}=25\cdot26+37^{2}=650+1369=2019 .
