Hölder inequality: (∑ a_i a_{i+1} a_{i+2})^{1/3} * (∑ 1)^{2/3} ≤ (∑ a_i^3)^{1/3} (∑ a_{i+1}^3)^{1/3} (∑ a_{i+2}^3)^{1/3}? Not.

